# GoMaster Tests

- Selectors: Provide explicit `data-testid="..."` on interactive board intersections, buttons, and evaluation panels.
- Test IDs: Register test cases in `docs/tests/CATALOG.md` before `.plan` closes.
- Test observable behavior and board states, not private implementation details.
- Fix production code under `.dev`; never weaken assertions to pass.
- Engine Isolation: Mock KataGo processes and Gemini API endpoints in automated test suites.
